          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A significant uptick in Russian combat operations or force posture in Ukraine drives NATO/US to surge and retain combat and deterrent units in Europe, reducing the pool of readily deployable forces for the Middle East and thus lowering deployment density near Israel." />
