          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.9" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Larger and longer military exercises directly bring additional ships, aircraft, and ground units into the theater and hold them in proximity to potential flashpoints, increasing local force concentration." />
