          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Larger or more frequent naval and air exercises conducted near maritime chokepoints lead authorities and commercial operators to close lanes, reroute tankers, or delay transits, directly reducing short‑term throughput." />
